        <body>
            <div xml:id="d339">

                <pb facs="0366" n="284" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg284"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/611.</note>
                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-08-01T13:00:00-04:49"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi>
                            1, 1911—1 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                    >p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>President Simon has informed the diplomatic corps that he is ready to resign and
                    requests three days’ armistice to arrange his affairs and embark on merchant
                    vessel. The diplomatic corps is treating with revolutionists.</p>
            </div>
